

This software is a Linux platform implemention of the paper
"Fast Adaptive Blue Noise on Polygonal Surfaces"i by Esdras Medeiros, Lis
Ingrid, Sinésio Pesco and Claudio Silva in Graphical Models, 2014.

File specifications:

- genus3.ply: the surface in ply format.
- genus3.obj.curveq.txt: the importance sampling of the blue noise.
  distribution.
- main: the program compiled in Linux 14.04 LTS platform
- script_test: the main script to run tests
- data: directory for data dump

Usage:

  ./script_test

For more details about parameters, see paper.
For any question please send an email to esdras@mat.ufc.br.




